This directory contains an abridged subset of the Unicode CLDR data (common/rbnf, the numbers and contextTransforms sections of common/main, and common/supplemental files), that are used only by the test suites.
It was taken from the CLDR repository at commit 96e54b273d2da4ec6fbad350ba19ff23fa24a588 (2026-10-21).

